<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Grant Information & Resources</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      background: #f5f7fa;
      color: #222;
    }

    header {
      background: #123b63;
      color: white;
      padding: 50px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 18px;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    nav {
      background: #0d2d4a;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .hero {
      background: white;
      padding: 35px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .hero h2 {
      color: #123b63;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #123b63;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .notice {
      background: #fff8df;
      border-left: 5px solid #d59b00;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    .contact {
      background: #123b63;
      color: white;
      padding: 35px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      background: #0d2d4a;
      color: white;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-top: 40px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header h1 {
        font-size: 28px;
      }

      nav a {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 5px 8px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>Grant Information & Resources</h1>
    <p>
      Providing general information and educational resources to help
      individuals and organizations better understand grant opportunities.
    </p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#grants">Grant Information</a>
    <a href="#process">How It Works</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <main class="container">

    <section id="about" class="hero">
      <h2>Welcome</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to my personal grant information website. My goal is to
        provide useful educational information about grants, funding
        opportunities, eligibility requirements, and the application process.
      </p>

      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Important:</strong>
        This is an independent informational website. It is not an official
        government website and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any
        government agency, Rotary organization, bank, or other funding
        institution unless specifically stated.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="grants" class="hero">
      <h2>Understanding Grant Opportunities</h2>

      <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Community Grants</h3>
          <p>
            Learn about funding opportunities that may support community
            projects, nonprofit activities, education, and local development.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Business Grants</h3>
          <p>
            Explore information about grants and other funding programs
            designed for eligible businesses and entrepreneurs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Education Funding</h3>
          <p>
            Find educational resources and information about scholarships,
            fellowships, and other legitimate funding opportunities.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="process" class="hero">
      <h2>Understanding the Application Process</h2>

      <div class="cards">

        <div class="card">
          <h3>1. Research</h3>
          <p>
            Identify a legitimate grant program and carefully review its
            official eligibility requirements.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>2. Check Eligibility</h3>
          <p>
            Make sure you meet the program's requirements before submitting
            an application.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>3. Apply Through the Official Source</h3>
          <p>
            Submit applications only through the official website or
            application system identified by the funding organization.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Be careful:</strong>
        Legitimate grant programs should clearly identify the funding
        organization, eligibility requirements, application process, and
        official contact information. Be cautious of anyone promising
        guaranteed grant money or requesting unusual upfront payments.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="contact">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        For general questions about the information presented on this
        website, please contact:
      </p>

      <br>

      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong>
        your-email@example.com
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Grant Information & Resources. All rights reserved.
    <br><br>
    This website provides general educational information and does not
    guarantee funding or grant approval.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
